{"book":"Tit","name":"Titus","chapters":{"1":{"1":{"text":"Paul, a servant of God, and an apostle of Jesus Christ, according to the faith of God's elect, and the acknowledging of the truth which is after godliness;","words":[{"t":"Paul,","s":["G3972"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"servant","s":["G1401"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God,","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"and","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"an"},{"t":"apostle","s":["G652"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"Jesus","s":["G2424"]},{"t":"Christ,","s":["G5547"]},{"t":"according"},{"t":"to","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"faith","s":["G4102"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God's","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"elect,","s":["G1588"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"acknowledging","s":["G1922"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth","s":["G225"]},{"t":"which","s":["G3588"]},{"t":"is"},{"t":"after","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"godliness;"}]},"2":{"text":"In hope of eternal life, which God, that cannot lie, promised before the world began;","words":[{"t":"In","s":["G1909"]},{"t":"hope","s":["G1680"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"eternal","s":["G166"]},{"t":"life,","s":["G2222"]},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"God,","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"cannot"},{"t":"lie,","s":["G893"]},{"t":"promised","s":["G1861"]},{"t":"before","s":["G4253"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"world","s":["G166"]},{"t":"began;"}]},"3":{"text":"But hath in due times manifested his word through preaching, which is committed unto me according to the commandment of God our Saviour;","words":[{"t":"But","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"hath","s":["G5319"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"due","s":["G2398"]},{"t":"times","s":["G2540"]},{"t":"manifested","s":["G5319"]},{"t":"his","s":["G846"]},{"t":"word","s":["G3056"]},{"t":"through","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"preaching,","s":["G2782"]},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"is"},{"t":"committed","s":["G4100"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"me","s":["G1473"]},{"t":"according"},{"t":"to","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"commandment","s":["G2003"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"Saviour;"}]},"4":{"text":"To Titus, mine own son after the common faith: Grace, mercy, and peace, from God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ our Saviour.","words":[{"t":"To"},{"t":"Titus,","s":["G5103"]},{"t":"mine","i":true},{"t":"own","s":["G1103"]},{"t":"son","s":["G5043"]},{"t":"after","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"common","s":["G2839"]},{"t":"faith:","s":["G4102"]},{"t":"Grace,","s":["G5485"]},{"t":"mercy,","s":["G1656"]},{"t":"and","i":true},{"t":"peace,","s":["G1515"]},{"t":"from","s":["G575"]},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Father","s":["G3962"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Lord","s":["G2962"]},{"t":"Jesus","s":["G2424"]},{"t":"Christ","s":["G5547"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"Saviour."}]},"5":{"text":"For this cause left I thee in Crete, that thou shouldest set in order the things that are wanting, and ordain elders in every city, as I had appointed thee:","words":[{"t":"For"},{"t":"this","s":["G5127"]},{"t":"cause","s":["G5484"]},{"t":"left"},{"t":"I","s":["G2641"]},{"t":"thee","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"Crete,","s":["G2914"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"shouldest"},{"t":"set"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"order","s":["G1930"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"things"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"are"},{"t":"wanting,","s":["G3007"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"ordain","s":["G2525"]},{"t":"elders","s":["G4245"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"every","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"city,","s":["G4172"]},{"t":"as","s":["G5613"]},{"t":"I","s":["G1473"]},{"t":"had"},{"t":"appointed","s":["G1299"]},{"t":"thee:"}]},"6":{"text":"If any be blameless, the husband of one wife, having faithful children not accused of riot or unruly.","words":[{"t":"If"},{"t":"any","s":["G1536"]},{"t":"be","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"blameless,","s":["G410"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"husband","s":["G435"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"one","s":["G3391"]},{"t":"wife,","s":["G1135"]},{"t":"having","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"faithful","s":["G4103"]},{"t":"children","s":["G5043"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"accused","s":["G1722","G2724"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"riot","s":["G810"]},{"t":"or","s":["G2228"]},{"t":"unruly."}]},"7":{"text":"For a bishop must be blameless, as the steward of God; not selfwilled, not soon angry, not given to wine, no striker, not given to filthy lucre;","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"bishop","s":["G1985"]},{"t":"must","s":["G1163"]},{"t":"be","s":["G1511"]},{"t":"blameless,","s":["G410"]},{"t":"as","s":["G5613"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"steward","s":["G3623"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God;","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"selfwilled,","s":["G829"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"soon"},{"t":"angry,","s":["G3711"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"given"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"wine,","s":["G3943"]},{"t":"no","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"striker,","s":["G4131"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"given"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"filthy"},{"t":"lucre;"}]},"8":{"text":"But a lover of hospitality, a lover of good men, sober, just, holy, temperate;","words":[{"t":"But","s":["G235"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"lover"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"hospitality,","s":["G5382"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"lover"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"good"},{"t":"men,","s":["G5358"]},{"t":"sober,","s":["G4998"]},{"t":"just,","s":["G1342"]},{"t":"holy,","s":["G3741"]},{"t":"temperate;"}]},"9":{"text":"Holding fast the faithful word as he hath been taught, that he may be able by sound doctrine both to exhort and to convince the gainsayers.","words":[{"t":"Holding"},{"t":"fast","s":["G472"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"faithful","s":["G4103"]},{"t":"word","s":["G3056"]},{"t":"as","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"hath"},{"t":"been"},{"t":"taught,","s":["G1322"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"may"},{"t":"be","s":["G5600"]},{"t":"able","s":["G1415"]},{"t":"by","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"sound","s":["G5198"]},{"t":"doctrine","s":["G1319"]},{"t":"both","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"exhort","s":["G3870"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"convince","s":["G1651"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"gainsayers."}]},"10":{"text":"For there are many unruly and vain talkers and deceivers, specially they of the circumcision:","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"there"},{"t":"are","s":["G1526"]},{"t":"many","s":["G4183"]},{"t":"unruly","s":["G506"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"vain"},{"t":"talkers","s":["G3151"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"deceivers,","s":["G5423"]},{"t":"specially","s":["G3122"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"of","s":["G1537"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"circumcision:"}]},"11":{"text":"Whose mouths must be stopped, who subvert whole houses, teaching things which they ought not, for filthy lucre's sake.","words":[{"t":"Whose","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"mouths","s":["G1993"]},{"t":"must","s":["G1163"]},{"t":"be"},{"t":"stopped,","s":["G1993"]},{"t":"who","s":["G3748"]},{"t":"subvert","s":["G396"]},{"t":"whole","s":["G3650"]},{"t":"houses,","s":["G3624"]},{"t":"teaching","s":["G1321"]},{"t":"things"},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"ought","s":["G1163"]},{"t":"not,","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"for","s":["G5484"]},{"t":"filthy","s":["G150"]},{"t":"lucre's","s":["G2771"]},{"t":"sake."}]},"12":{"text":"One of themselves, even a prophet of their own, said, The Cretians are alway liars, evil beasts, slow bellies.","words":[{"t":"One","s":["G5100"]},{"t":"of","s":["G1537"]},{"t":"themselves,","s":["G846"]},{"t":"even","i":true},{"t":"a"},{"t":"prophet","s":["G4396"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"their","s":["G846"]},{"t":"own,","s":["G2398"]},{"t":"said,","s":["G2036"]},{"t":"The"},{"t":"Cretians","s":["G2912"]},{"t":"are","i":true},{"t":"alway","s":["G104"]},{"t":"liars,","s":["G5583"]},{"t":"evil","s":["G2556"]},{"t":"beasts,","s":["G2342"]},{"t":"slow","s":["G692"]},{"t":"bellies."}]},"13":{"text":"This witness is true. Wherefore rebuke them sharply, that they may be sound in the faith;","words":[{"t":"This","s":["G3778"]},{"t":"witness","s":["G3141"]},{"t":"is","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"true.","s":["G227"]},{"t":"Wherefore","s":["G1223","G3739","G156"]},{"t":"rebuke","s":["G1651"]},{"t":"them","s":["G846"]},{"t":"sharply,","s":["G664"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"may"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"sound","s":["G5198"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"faith;"}]},"14":{"text":"Not giving heed to Jewish fables, and commandments of men, that turn from the truth.","words":[{"t":"Not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"giving"},{"t":"heed","s":["G4337"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"Jewish","s":["G2451"]},{"t":"fables,","s":["G3454"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"commandments","s":["G1785"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"men,","s":["G444"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"turn"},{"t":"from","s":["G654"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth."}]},"15":{"text":"Unto the pure all things are pure: but unto them that are defiled and unbelieving is nothing pure; but even their mind and conscience is defiled.","words":[{"t":"Unto"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"pure","s":["G2513"]},{"t":"all"},{"t":"things","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"are","i":true},{"t":"pure:","s":["G3303","G2513"]},{"t":"but","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"them"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"are"},{"t":"defiled","s":["G3392"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"unbelieving","s":["G571"]},{"t":"is","i":true},{"t":"nothing","s":["G3762"]},{"t":"pure;","s":["G2513"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"even","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"their","s":["G846"]},{"t":"mind","s":["G3563"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"conscience","s":["G4893"]},{"t":"is"},{"t":"defiled."}]},"16":{"text":"They profess that they know God; but in works they deny him, being abominable, and disobedient, and unto every good work reprobate.","words":[{"t":"They"},{"t":"profess","s":["G3670"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"they"},{"t":"know","s":["G1492"]},{"t":"God;","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"but","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"works","s":["G2041"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"deny","s":["G720"]},{"t":"him,","i":true},{"t":"being","s":["G5607"]},{"t":"abominable,","s":["G947"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"disobedient,","s":["G545"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"unto","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"every","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"good","s":["G18"]},{"t":"work","s":["G2041"]},{"t":"reprobate."}]}},"2":{"1":{"text":"But speak thou the things which become sound doctrine:","words":[{"t":"But","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"speak","s":["G2980"]},{"t":"thou","s":["G4771"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"things"},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"become","s":["G4241"]},{"t":"sound","s":["G5198"]},{"t":"doctrine:"}]},"2":{"text":"That the aged men be sober, grave, temperate, sound in faith, in charity, in patience.","words":[{"t":"That"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"aged"},{"t":"men","s":["G4246"]},{"t":"be","s":["G1511"]},{"t":"sober,","s":["G3524"]},{"t":"grave,","s":["G4586"]},{"t":"temperate,","s":["G4998"]},{"t":"sound","s":["G5198"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"faith,","s":["G4102"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"charity,","s":["G26"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"patience."}]},"3":{"text":"The aged women likewise, that they be in behaviour as becometh holiness, not false accusers, not given to much wine, teachers of good things;","words":[{"t":"The"},{"t":"aged"},{"t":"women","s":["G4247"]},{"t":"likewise,","s":["G5615"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"they","i":true},{"t":"be","i":true},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"behaviour","s":["G2688"]},{"t":"as"},{"t":"becometh"},{"t":"holiness,","s":["G2412"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"false"},{"t":"accusers,","s":["G1228"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"given","s":["G1402"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"much","s":["G4183"]},{"t":"wine,","s":["G3631"]},{"t":"teachers"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"good"},{"t":"things;"}]},"4":{"text":"That they may teach the young women to be sober, to love their husbands, to love their children,","words":[{"t":"That","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"may"},{"t":"teach","s":["G4994"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"young"},{"t":"women","s":["G3501"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"be","s":["G1511"]},{"t":"sober,","s":["G4994"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"love"},{"t":"their"},{"t":"husbands,","s":["G5362"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"love"},{"t":"their"},{"t":"children,"}]},"5":{"text":"To be discreet, chaste, keepers at home, good, obedient to their own husbands, that the word of God be not blasphemed.","words":[{"t":"To","i":true},{"t":"be","i":true},{"t":"discreet,","s":["G4998"]},{"t":"chaste,","s":["G53"]},{"t":"keepers"},{"t":"at"},{"t":"home,","s":["G3626"]},{"t":"good,","s":["G18"]},{"t":"obedient","s":["G5293"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"their"},{"t":"own","s":["G2398"]},{"t":"husbands,","s":["G435"]},{"t":"that","s":["G3363"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"word","s":["G3056"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"be","s":["G987"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3363"]},{"t":"blasphemed."}]},"6":{"text":"Young men likewise exhort to be sober minded.","words":[{"t":"Young"},{"t":"men","s":["G3501"]},{"t":"likewise","s":["G5615"]},{"t":"exhort","s":["G3870"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"sober"},{"t":"minded."}]},"7":{"text":"In all things shewing thyself a pattern of good works: in doctrine shewing uncorruptness, gravity, sincerity,","words":[{"t":"In","s":["G4012"]},{"t":"all"},{"t":"things","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"shewing","s":["G3930"]},{"t":"thyself","s":["G4572"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"pattern","s":["G5179"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"good","s":["G2570"]},{"t":"works:","s":["G2041"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"doctrine","s":["G1319"]},{"t":"shewing","i":true},{"t":"uncorruptness,","s":["G90"]},{"t":"gravity,","s":["G4587"]},{"t":"sincerity,"}]},"8":{"text":"Sound speech, that cannot be condemned; that he that is of the contrary part may be ashamed, having no evil thing to say of you.","words":[{"t":"Sound","s":["G5199"]},{"t":"speech,","s":["G3056"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"cannot"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"condemned;","s":["G176"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"of","s":["G1537"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"contrary"},{"t":"part","s":["G1727"]},{"t":"may"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"ashamed,","s":["G1788"]},{"t":"having","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"no","s":["G3367"]},{"t":"evil","s":["G5337"]},{"t":"thing","s":["G3367"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"say","s":["G3004"]},{"t":"of","s":["G4012"]},{"t":"you."}]},"9":{"text":"Exhort servants to be obedient unto their own masters, and to please them well in all things; not answering again;","words":[{"t":"Exhort","i":true},{"t":"servants","s":["G1401"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"obedient","s":["G5293"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"their"},{"t":"own","s":["G2398"]},{"t":"masters,","s":["G1203"]},{"t":"and","i":true},{"t":"to","s":["G1511"]},{"t":"please"},{"t":"them","i":true},{"t":"well","s":["G2101"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"things;","i":true},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"answering"},{"t":"again;"}]},"10":{"text":"Not purloining, but shewing all good fidelity; that they may adorn the doctrine of God our Saviour in all things.","words":[{"t":"Not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"purloining,","s":["G3557"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"shewing","s":["G1731"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"good","s":["G18"]},{"t":"fidelity;","s":["G4102"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"may"},{"t":"adorn","s":["G2885"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"doctrine","s":["G1319"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"Saviour","s":["G4990"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"all"},{"t":"things."}]},"11":{"text":"For the grace of God that bringeth salvation hath appeared to all men,","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"grace","s":["G5485"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"bringeth"},{"t":"salvation","s":["G4992"]},{"t":"hath"},{"t":"appeared","s":["G2014"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"men,"}]},"12":{"text":"Teaching us that, denying ungodliness and worldly lusts, we should live soberly, righteously, and godly, in this present world;","words":[{"t":"Teaching","s":["G3811"]},{"t":"us","s":["G2248"]},{"t":"that,","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"denying","s":["G720"]},{"t":"ungodliness","s":["G763"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"worldly","s":["G2886"]},{"t":"lusts,","s":["G1939"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"should"},{"t":"live","s":["G2198"]},{"t":"soberly,","s":["G4996","G2532"]},{"t":"righteously,","s":["G1346"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"godly,","s":["G2153"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"this"},{"t":"present","s":["G3568"]},{"t":"world;"}]},"13":{"text":"Looking for that blessed hope, and the glorious appearing of the great God and our Saviour Jesus Christ;","words":[{"t":"Looking"},{"t":"for","s":["G4327"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"blessed","s":["G3107"]},{"t":"hope,","s":["G1680"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"glorious","s":["G1391"]},{"t":"appearing","s":["G2015"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"great","s":["G3173"]},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"Saviour","s":["G4990"]},{"t":"Jesus","s":["G2424"]},{"t":"Christ;"}]},"14":{"text":"Who gave himself for us, that he might redeem us from all iniquity, and purify unto himself a peculiar people, zealous of good works.","words":[{"t":"Who","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"gave","s":["G1325"]},{"t":"himself","s":["G1438"]},{"t":"for","s":["G5228"]},{"t":"us,","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"might"},{"t":"redeem","s":["G3084"]},{"t":"us","s":["G2248"]},{"t":"from","s":["G575"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"iniquity,","s":["G458"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"purify","s":["G2511"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"himself","s":["G1438"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"peculiar","s":["G4041"]},{"t":"people,","s":["G2992"]},{"t":"zealous","s":["G2207"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"good","s":["G2570"]},{"t":"works."}]},"15":{"text":"These things speak, and exhort, and rebuke with all authority. Let no man despise thee.","words":[{"t":"These"},{"t":"things","s":["G5023"]},{"t":"speak,","s":["G2980"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"exhort,","s":["G3870"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"rebuke","s":["G1651"]},{"t":"with","s":["G3326"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"authority.","s":["G2003"]},{"t":"Let","s":["G4065"]},{"t":"no"},{"t":"man","s":["G3367"]},{"t":"despise","s":["G4065"]},{"t":"thee."}]}},"3":{"1":{"text":"Put them in mind to be subject to principalities and powers, to obey magistrates, to be ready to every good work,","words":[{"t":"Put","s":["G5279"]},{"t":"them","s":["G846"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"mind","s":["G5279"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"subject","s":["G5293"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"principalities","s":["G746"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"powers,","s":["G1849"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"obey"},{"t":"magistrates,","s":["G3980"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"be","s":["G1511"]},{"t":"ready","s":["G2092"]},{"t":"to","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"every","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"good","s":["G18"]},{"t":"work,"}]},"2":{"text":"To speak evil of no man, to be no brawlers, but gentle, shewing all meekness unto all men.","words":[{"t":"To"},{"t":"speak"},{"t":"evil"},{"t":"of","s":["G987"]},{"t":"no"},{"t":"man,","s":["G3367"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"be","s":["G1511"]},{"t":"no"},{"t":"brawlers,","s":["G269"]},{"t":"but","i":true},{"t":"gentle,","s":["G1933"]},{"t":"shewing","s":["G1731"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"meekness","s":["G4236"]},{"t":"unto","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"men."}]},"3":{"text":"For we ourselves also were sometimes foolish, disobedient, deceived, serving divers lusts and pleasures, living in malice and envy, hateful, and hating one another.","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"ourselves","s":["G2249"]},{"t":"also","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"were","s":["G2258"]},{"t":"sometimes","s":["G4218"]},{"t":"foolish,","s":["G453"]},{"t":"disobedient,","s":["G545"]},{"t":"deceived,","s":["G4105"]},{"t":"serving","s":["G1398"]},{"t":"divers","s":["G4164"]},{"t":"lusts","s":["G1939"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"pleasures,","s":["G2237"]},{"t":"living","s":["G1236"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"malice","s":["G2549"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"envy,","s":["G5355"]},{"t":"hateful,","s":["G4767"]},{"t":"and","i":true},{"t":"hating","s":["G3404"]},{"t":"one"},{"t":"another."}]},"4":{"text":"But after that the kindness and love of God our Saviour toward man appeared,","words":[{"t":"But","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"after","s":["G3753"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"kindness","s":["G5544"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"love","s":["G5363"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"Saviour","s":["G4990"]},{"t":"toward"},{"t":"man","s":["G5363"]},{"t":"appeared,"}]},"5":{"text":"Not by works of righteousness which we have done, but according to his mercy he saved us, by the washing of regeneration, and renewing of the Holy Ghost;","words":[{"t":"Not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"by","s":["G1537"]},{"t":"works","s":["G2041"]},{"t":"of","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"righteousness","s":["G1343"]},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"we","s":["G2249"]},{"t":"have"},{"t":"done,","s":["G4160"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"according"},{"t":"to","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"his","s":["G846"]},{"t":"mercy","s":["G1656"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"saved","s":["G4982"]},{"t":"us,","s":["G2248"]},{"t":"by","s":["G1223"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"washing","s":["G3067"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"regeneration,","s":["G3824"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"renewing","s":["G342"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Holy","s":["G40"]},{"t":"Ghost;"}]},"6":{"text":"Which he shed on us abundantly through Jesus Christ our Saviour;","words":[{"t":"Which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"shed","s":["G1632"]},{"t":"on","s":["G1909"]},{"t":"us","s":["G2248"]},{"t":"abundantly","s":["G4146"]},{"t":"through","s":["G1223"]},{"t":"Jesus","s":["G2424"]},{"t":"Christ","s":["G5547"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"Saviour;"}]},"7":{"text":"That being justified by his grace, we should be made heirs according to the hope of eternal life.","words":[{"t":"That","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"being"},{"t":"justified"},{"t":"by","s":["G1344"]},{"t":"his","s":["G1565"]},{"t":"grace,","s":["G5485"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"should"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"made","s":["G1096"]},{"t":"heirs","s":["G2818"]},{"t":"according"},{"t":"to","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"hope","s":["G1680"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"eternal","s":["G166"]},{"t":"life."}]},"8":{"text":"This is a faithful saying, and these things I will that thou affirm constantly, that they which have believed in God might be careful to maintain good works. These things are good and profitable unto men.","words":[{"t":"This","i":true},{"t":"is","i":true},{"t":"a"},{"t":"faithful","s":["G4103"]},{"t":"saying,","s":["G3056"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"these"},{"t":"things","s":["G4012","G5130"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"will","s":["G1014"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"thou","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"affirm"},{"t":"constantly,","s":["G1226"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"which"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"believed","s":["G4100"]},{"t":"in"},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"might"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"careful","s":["G5431"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"maintain","s":["G4291"]},{"t":"good","s":["G2570"]},{"t":"works.","s":["G2041"]},{"t":"These"},{"t":"things","s":["G5023"]},{"t":"are","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"good","s":["G2570"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"profitable","s":["G5624"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"men."}]},"9":{"text":"But avoid foolish questions, and genealogies, and contentions, and strivings about the law; for they are unprofitable and vain.","words":[{"t":"But","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"avoid","s":["G4026"]},{"t":"foolish","s":["G3474"]},{"t":"questions,","s":["G2214"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"genealogies,","s":["G1076"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"contentions,","s":["G2054"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"strivings"},{"t":"about","s":["G3163"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"law;","s":["G3544"]},{"t":"for","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"are","s":["G1526"]},{"t":"unprofitable","s":["G512"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"vain."}]},"10":{"text":"A man that is an heretick after the first and second admonition reject;","words":[{"t":"A"},{"t":"man","s":["G444"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"an"},{"t":"heretick","s":["G141"]},{"t":"after","s":["G3326"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"first","s":["G3391"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"second","s":["G1208"]},{"t":"admonition","s":["G3559"]},{"t":"reject;"}]},"11":{"text":"Knowing that he that is such is subverted, and sinneth, being condemned of himself.","words":[{"t":"Knowing","s":["G1492"]},{"t":"that","s":["G3754"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"such","s":["G5108"]},{"t":"is"},{"t":"subverted,","s":["G1612"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"sinneth,","s":["G264"]},{"t":"being","s":["G5607"]},{"t":"condemned"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"himself."}]},"12":{"text":"When I shall send Artemas unto thee, or Tychicus, be diligent to come unto me to Nicopolis: for I have determined there to winter.","words":[{"t":"When","s":["G3752"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"shall"},{"t":"send","s":["G3992"]},{"t":"Artemas","s":["G734"]},{"t":"unto","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"thee,","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"or","s":["G2228"]},{"t":"Tychicus,","s":["G5190"]},{"t":"be"},{"t":"diligent","s":["G4704"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"come","s":["G2064"]},{"t":"unto","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"me","s":["G3165"]},{"t":"to","s":["G1519"]},{"t":"Nicopolis:","s":["G3533"]},{"t":"for","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"determined","s":["G2919"]},{"t":"there","s":["G1563"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"winter."}]},"13":{"text":"Bring Zenas the lawyer and Apollos on their journey diligently, that nothing be wanting unto them.","words":[{"t":"Bring","s":["G4311"]},{"t":"Zenas","s":["G2211"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"lawyer","s":["G3544"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"Apollos","s":["G625"]},{"t":"on"},{"t":"their"},{"t":"journey","s":["G4311"]},{"t":"diligently,","s":["G4709"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"nothing","s":["G3367"]},{"t":"be"},{"t":"wanting","s":["G3007"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"them."}]},"14":{"text":"And let ours also learn to maintain good works for necessary uses, that they be not unfruitful.","words":[{"t":"And","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"let","s":["G3129"]},{"t":"ours","s":["G2251"]},{"t":"also","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"learn","s":["G3129"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"maintain","s":["G4291"]},{"t":"good","s":["G2570"]},{"t":"works","s":["G2041"]},{"t":"for","s":["G1519"]},{"t":"necessary","s":["G316"]},{"t":"uses,","s":["G5532"]},{"t":"that","s":["G3363"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"be","s":["G5600"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3363"]},{"t":"unfruitful."}]},"15":{"text":"All that are with me salute thee. Greet them that love us in the faith. Grace be with you all. Amen.","words":[{"t":"All","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"are"},{"t":"with","s":["G3326"]},{"t":"me","s":["G1700"]},{"t":"salute","s":["G782"]},{"t":"thee.","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"Greet","s":["G782"]},{"t":"them"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"love","s":["G5368"]},{"t":"us","s":["G2248"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"faith.","s":["G4102"]},{"t":"Grace","s":["G5485"]},{"t":"be","i":true},{"t":"with","s":["G3326"]},{"t":"you","s":["G5216"]},{"t":"all.","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"Amen."}]}}}}